Build RViz 14 (Jazzy) against Qt 6.

This tree has Qt 6.8 only (ports/qt6); Jazzy's RViz finds Qt5 alone. Upstream
added Qt 6 support on rolling; this is those commits backported to 14.1.24:
  433016130f feat: support both qt5 and qt6 (#1187)
  d59672f911 Fix compile with qt6 (#1475)
  ce030d4a46 Replace QRegExp with QRegularExpression to support Qt6 (#1592)
  689f3587ca Removed Qt6 warnings (#1704)
(conflicts only in include lists; the ros_service_property files of
ce030d4a46 do not exist in Jazzy and are left out).

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/ros2/rviz, rolling]
---
